# Keep these (committed — audit trail and state):
# .pipeline/archive/     DO NOT gitignore
# .claude/PIPELINE_STATE.json  DO NOT gitignore
# DAILY_REPORT.md        DO NOT gitignore
# CHANGELOG_PIPELINE.md  DO NOT gitignore

